s and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2a\\cdot (b\\times c) & =-12 \\\\ 2\\cdot [a\\cdot (b\\times c)] & =-12 \\\\ a\\cdot (b\\times c) & =-6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we swap $a$ and $b$ to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b\\cdot (a\\times c) & =6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand again we swap $a$ and $c$ to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b\\cdot (c\\times a) & =-6.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["34c1982d-f231-5481-b3e9-e68a23b4ac5e"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "0247d9d4-0adf-5b41-95a1-fcfebd8e0869" :answer/id #uuid "0247d9d4-0adf-5b41-95a1-fcfebd8e0869" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "48" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "b9be68d2-adcf-5ee3-9d21-747b5641b3b3" :answer/id #uuid "b9be68d2-adcf-5ee3-9d21-747b5641b3b3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-48" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "7d06e647-676d-5959-8639-f90018e027b1" :answer/id #uuid "7d06e647-676d-5959-8639-f90018e027b1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-16" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "1ae2f448-6b56-5e4a-bfbf-61279f25e760" :answer/id #uuid "1ae2f448-6b56-5e4a-bfbf-61279f25e760" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "9fd1eb97-a2fa-5e5f-bbcc-f7497c7765b1" :answer/id #uuid "9fd1eb97-a2fa-5e5f-bbcc-f7497c7765b1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "722bea6e-7984-59f0-a1be-ce656c531cb1" :answer-field/id #uuid "722bea6e-7984-59f0-a1be-ce656c531cb1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["0247d9d4-0adf-5b41-95a1-fcfebd8e0869" "b9be68d2-adcf-5ee3-9d21-747b5641b3b3" "7d06e647-676d-5959-8639-f90018e027b1" "1ae2f448-6b56-5e4a-bfbf-61279f25e760" "9fd1eb97-a2fa-5e5f-bbcc-f7497c7765b1"] :answer-field/correct "b9be68d2-adcf-5ee3-9d21-747b5641b3b3" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "371a5e09-afe1-5a22-8d4f-574703d014c6" :question/id #uuid "371a5e09-afe1-5a22-8d4f-574703d014c6" :question/problem "Find $b\\cdot ((-4)c\\times 3a)$, if $4a\\cdot (2b\\times (-4)c)=-128.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we factor out the constants and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4a\\cdot (2b\\times (-4)c) & =-128 \\\\ 4\\cdot 2\\cdot (-4)\\cdot [a\\cdot (b\\times c)] & =-128 \\\\ a\\cdot (b\\times c) & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we swap $a$ and $b$ to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b\\cdot (a\\times c) & =-4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand again we swap $a$ and $c$ to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b\\cdot (c\\times a) & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFactoring out the constants in the requested product, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b\\cdot ((-4)c\\times 3a) & =(-4)\\cdot 3[b\\cdot (c\\times a)] \\\\ & =(-4)\\cdot 3\\cdot 4 \\\\ & =-48.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["722bea6e-7984-59f0-a1be-ce656c531cb1"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "3a4a0f8b-6a4e-58a2-ba3b-2c77b5f60813" :answer/id #uuid "3a4a0f8b-6a4e-58a2-ba3b-2c77b5f60813" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-108" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "6148d277-f3fd-50e0-8254-cc45eb1f58c2" :answer/id #uuid "6148d277-f3fd-50e0-8254-cc45eb1f58c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-9" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "79e45480-0699-5872-b6ca-b9b3a11b8ec4" :answer/id #uuid "79e45480-0699-5872-b6ca-b9b3a11b8ec4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-27" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e24c6cdb-2f0d-5255-ae81-7e6507e258b7" :answer/id #uuid "e24c6cdb-2f0d-5255-ae81-7e6507e258b7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "108" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "f65af0a7-ee33-528c-b9b1-79bbdeaf559c" :answer/id #uuid "f65af0a7-ee33-528c-b9b1-79bbdeaf559c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-36" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "b9caec51-8a8d-5578-9989-3468b3cc50be" :answer-field/id #uuid "b9caec51-8a8d-5578-9989-3468b3cc50be" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type